WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.410
Two news sites.

2
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.470
The same harbour, the same small boats.

3
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.410
The Daily Beacon: Migrants
flood in at Port Ellis.

4
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:13.450
The Greyport Ledger: a hundred and twenty
people arrive at Port Ellis by boat.

5
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.660
Then another pair.

6
00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:16.560
Police injure 12.

7
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:18.870
And just: 12 injured.

8
00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.320
Who disappeared?

9
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.330
Same people, same event,
and only the words changed.

10
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.290
So what did the verb do?

11
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.510
In this mission, you'll put
one word under the microscope,

12
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:32.550
and ask what else it
carries besides the facts.

13
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.270
And you'll track who does what to
whom, and ask where the doer went.

14
00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.140
Your mission: work out what the verb did.
